# The kani rung's declaration for this component.
#
# The tree carries its own proof harnesses (40 `#[kani::proof]` functions across
# the eight modules listed below), and `kani.yml` compiles the crate under
# `--cfg kani` with Kani pinned at 0.67.0, on workflow_dispatch and weekly: the
# lane decision lives in the host repository at
# https://github.com/slartibardfast/agentic-ds-lite-punch/blob/main/call/0050-the-kani-rung-runs-on-a-runner-and-the-trees-own-harnesses-gate.md
# and its green runs are receipted as the phase ci lane
# `software/ds-lite-punch/main/kani`.
#
# One row per module's harness set: the id labels the set, and the disposition
# names the module the harnesses live in. A harness that stops compiling fails
# its own step in the lane, which is the gate the declaration buys.

engine-harnesses => kani:engine.rs
mapping-harnesses => kani:mapping.rs
obs-harnesses => kani:obs.rs
slot-harnesses => kani:slot.rs
stun-harnesses => kani:stun.rs
tcpslot-harnesses => kani:tcpslot.rs
upnp-harnesses => kani:upnp.rs
vote-harnesses => kani:vote.rs
